e settlement involves TikTok adding several child safety measures to its platform including time limits and increased parental control. It is similar to a recent settlement competitor Meta had reached.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Yemeni leader calls for general mobilization against Houthis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ba09b8d7c6f153a503d12ee20662a824e37922db976a031e6104bd2e0c51a920</id><updated>2026-09-26T05:11:04Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T21:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/yemeni-leader-calls-for-general-mobilization-against-houthis/a-79439604--0bc1a71d540c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/yemeni-leader-calls-for-general-mobilization-against-houthis/a-79439604?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Amid military escalation with the Iran-backed Houthis, the Saudi-backed head of Yemen's governing body urged his compatriots to join the government forces.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Lula or Bolsonaro as president? Brazil gears up to vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:003b74ab36b26cc1f80ae498cfea48daa7669fb3760427009fee815040ff600d</id><updated>2026-09-26T05:11:07Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T20:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/lula-or-bolsonaro-as-president-brazil-gears-up-to-vote/a-79437276--a6f357f68a3e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/lula-or-bolsonaro-as-president-brazil-gears-up-to-vote/a-79437276?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazilians go to the polls on October 4. The front-runners are multilateralist incumbent Lula da Silva and former President Jair Bolsonaro's son, Flavio, who wants to bring Brazil closer to the US and away from China.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Parliament approves fuel tax cut</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:495b0262215403271f61e3e0c9060556b98f64