ence and the US Constitution.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>AfD, CDU ban new Holocaust 'stumbling stones' in Heidenau</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:757489b0c565351a3839d4a5f4155902e882bbd199ad79790bda11a5bed748fb</id><updated>2026-09-26T05:10:01Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afd-cdu-ban-new-holocaust-stumbling-stones-in-heidenau/a-79433919--bafd061ca07a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afd-cdu-ban-new-holocaust-stumbling-stones-in-heidenau/a-79433919?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Activists, politicians and representatives of Holocaust victims reacted with anger after the center-right CDU party joined forces with the AfD to ban new Stolpersteine (stumbling stones) in the eastern town of Heidenau.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Lithuanian skies are NATO skies': DW speaks with Lithuanian premier Mindaugas Sinkevicius</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e21c20d5bdb2b150c526a71436b823940ad9f0c5a0f420e61a0096f09a728f0b</id><updated>2026-09-26T05:10:01Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/lithuanian-skies-are-nato-skies-dw-speaks-with-lithuanian-premier-mindaugas-sinkevicius/a-79432394--2e48449cf03c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/lithuanian-skies-are-nato-skies-dw-speaks-with-lithuanian-premier-mindaugas-sinkevicius/a-79432394?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In a DW interview, Prime Minister Mindaugas Sinkevicius discussed threats to Lithuania from Russia and Belarus, NATO's need for stronger air defense and why military spending alone cannot ensure security.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Protests against election chief escalate as Gandhi, Cockroach party allege 'rigged' vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1383048fc360887b8fa